THIS IS PRE-PRE-RELEASE SOFTWARE - USE AT YOUR OWN RISK!

Hopefully if you have a 274x/284x that functions using the unmodified
driver, it will continue to function.  It appears that some machines
use a different interrupt type than I assumed, however - this patch
attempts to detect and correct those.
:ja

